<section class="page page-stock-market" id="page-stock-market">
          <div class="page-toolbar"><div><span class="section-kicker">VIRTUAL MARKET</span><h2>股市管理</h2><p>管理虚拟股票、暂停状态、周期报价和交易审计。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" id="stockReload" type="button">↻ 刷新</button></div>
          <p class="risk-note stock-interface-notice" id="stockInterfaceNotice" hidden>部分股市接口未加载，请重启服务后刷新页面。</p>
          <div class="stockSummaryGrid" id="stockSummaryGrid"></div>
          <form class="card form-card stock-hours-card" id="stockMarketHoursForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>市场交易时段</h3><p>固定 Asia/Shanghai，保存后热重载。</p></div><strong id="stockAdminMarketStatus">读取中</strong></div><div class="stock-hours-layout"><fieldset class="stock-weekdays"><legend>交易日</legend><div class="stock-weekday-options"><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="1" checked><span>周一</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="2" checked><span>周二</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="3" checked><span>周三</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="4" checked><span>周四</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="5" checked><span>周五</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="6" checked><span>周六</span></label><label><input name="tradingDays" type="checkbox" value="7" checked><span>周日</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="stock-hours-fields"><label>开市<input name="openTime" type="time" required></label><label>闭市<input name="closeTime" type="time" required></label><label class="switch stock-enabled-switch"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span></span>启用市场</label></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存交易时段</button></div></form>
          <form class="card form-card stock-instrument-card" id="stockForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>股票标的</h3><p>编辑时当前价只读，必须通过人工调价审计。</p></div><select id="stockSelect" aria-label="选择股票"><option value="">新建股票</option></select></div><div class="stock-form-sections"><section class="stock-form-group"><div class="stock-form-group-title"><strong>基础信息</strong><span>标识、价格边界与说明</span></div><div class="form-grid cols-3"><label>代码<input name="code" maxlength="16" required></label><label>名称<input name="name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>初始/当前价<input name="currentPrice" type="number" min="1" required></label><label>基准价<input name="basePrice" type="number" min="1" required></label><label>最低价<input name="minPrice" type="number" min="1" required></label><label class="span-3">说明<textarea name="description" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label></div></section><section class="stock-form-group stock-auto-pricing-group"><div class="stock-form-group-title"><strong>自动定价</strong><span>设置自动调价的周期、依据和波动范围</span></div><div class="form-grid cols-3 stock-auto-pricing-grid"><label>定价周期（秒）<input name="periodSeconds" type="number" min="1" max="86400" placeholder="例如：60" required><small class="stock-field-hint">每隔多少秒自动重新计算一次价格</small></label><label>定价方式<select name="pricingMode"><option value="volume">仅按成交量</option><option value="hybrid">成交量 + 随机波动</option><option value="manual">仅允许人工调价</option></select><small class="stock-field-hint">决定自动价格使用哪些计算因素</small></label><label>成交量统计方式<select name="volumeMetric"><option value="quantity">按成交件数</option><option value="amount">按成交金额</option></select><small class="stock-field-hint">选择成交信号按件数还是商城币金额统计</small></label><label>正常成交基准<input name="baselineValue" type="number" min="1" placeholder="例如：100" required><small class="stock-field-hint">达到此数值视为正常成交水平，高低差异影响价格</small></label><label>自动成交量上限<input name="autoVolumeMax" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" placeholder="例如：150" required><small class="stock-field-hint">每个自动定价周期随机生成 0 至该数值的 K 线成交量，填 0 表示关闭</small></label><label>成交影响强度（基点）<input name="volumeSensitivityBps" type="number" min="0" max="10000" placeholder="100 = 1%" required><small class="stock-field-hint">成交偏离基准时的价格影响，100 基点等于 1%</small></label><label>随机波动上限（基点）<input name="volatilityBps" type="number" min="0" max="10000" placeholder="0 = 关闭" required><small class="stock-field-hint">每次定价允许加入的随机变化，填 0 表示关闭</small></label><label>单次最大涨跌（基点）<input name="maxChangeBps" type="number" min="0" max="10000" placeholder="500 = 5%" required><small class="stock-field-hint">限制一次自动定价最多涨跌多少，防止价格跳变</small></label></div></section><section class="stock-form-group"><div class="stock-form-group-title"><strong>交易设置</strong><span>手续费与可交易状态</span></div><div class="form-grid cols-3 stock-trade-settings"><label>手续费（基点）<input name="feeBps" type="number" min="0" max="10000" required></label><label class="switch"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span></span>启用</label><label class="switch"><input name="paused" type="checkbox"><span></span>暂停交易</label></div></section></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn danger" id="stockDelete" type="button" disabled>删除股票</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存股票</button></div></form>
          <div class="stock-operation-target" id="stockOperationTarget" role="status">当前编辑标的：新建股票模式</div><div class="stock-operations-grid"><form class="card form-card stock-workbench-card" id="stockManualPriceForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>人工调价</h3><p>价格变更将写入管理员审计。</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label>新价格<input name="newPrice" type="number" min="1" required></label><label>原因<textarea name="reason" maxlength="500" required></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">提交人工调价</button></div></form><form class="card form-card stock-workbench-card" id="stockBindingForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>成交绑定</h3><p>按商品或分类汇总成交信号。</p></div></div><input name="bindingId" type="hidden"><div class="form-grid stock-binding-grid"><label>类型<select name="bindingType"><option value="product">商品</option><option value="category">分类</option></select></label><label data-stock-binding-product>商品 ID<input name="productId" type="number" min="1"></label><label data-stock-binding-product>SKU<input name="productSku" maxlength="64"></label><label data-stock-binding-category>父分类<input name="parentCategory" maxlength="100"></label><label data-stock-binding-category>分类<input name="categoryName" maxlength="100"></label><label>权重基点<input name="weightBps" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="10000"></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn secondary" id="stockBindingReset" type="button">清空编辑</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存绑定</button></div><div class="stock-record-list" id="stockBindingRows"></div></form></div>
          <form class="card form-card stock-announcement-card" id="stockAnnouncementForm"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>市场公告</h3><p>编辑区与已发布公告分区展示。</p></div></div><input name="announcementId" type="hidden"><section class="stock-announcement-editor"><div class="stock-section-label">公告表单</div><div class="form-grid cols-3"><label>标题<input name="title" maxlength="150" required></label><label>开始<input name="startsAt" type="datetime-local"></label><label>结束<input name="endsAt" type="datetime-local"></label><label class="span-3">内容<textarea name="content" required></textarea></label><label class="switch"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked><span></span>启用</label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn secondary" id="stockAnnouncementReset" type="button">新建公告</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存公告</button></div></section><section class="stock-announcement-list"><div class="stock-section-label">公告列表</div><div class="stock-record-list" id="stockAnnouncementRows"></div></section></form>
        </section>

